e-and-magic", "storyline": "When the old can no longer protect the land, the small must learn to carry the tune.\n\nFor as long as anyone can remember, a kind witch has cared for the forest and the creatures who call it home. But now, the world is beginning to fall out of harmony\u2014and the witch who has always protected it is growing ill.\n\nHer smallest familiars must venture beyond the shelter of home and learn to carry the responsibility that once belonged to her. Though she cannot join them, her magic is never far away\u2014a gentle hand, ready to lift them back to safety.\n\nPlaying as a brave little mouse, you\u2019ll journey through a vast world shaped by the beauty and wonder of Swedish nature, helping those you meet and restoring harmony one act of kindness at a time.", "summary": "See the world through the eyes of a brave little mouse in this enchanting 3D co-op adventure. Explore breathtaking landscapes inspired by Northern Sweden, solve puzzles, and be a force for good in a land where heartwarming storytelling and the beauty of nature intertwine.", "themes": [{"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}, {"id": 38, "name": "Open world"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/hela-of-mice-and-magic", "videos": [{"id": 123746, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "DwucUWsaBsU", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DwucUWsaBsU", "title": "Hela | World Premiere Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/DwucUWsaBsU/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 133692, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "GpyXhW96wCk", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GpyXhW96wCk", "title": "Hela - Announcement Trailer | PS5 Games", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/GpyXhW96wCk/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 153298, "name": "Gameplay Trailer", "video_id": "3cQGfQQRFfI", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3cQGfQQRFfI", "title": "Hela Gameplay Trailer - Future Games Show Summer Showcase 2025", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/3cQGfQQRFfI/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 157659, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "IHRS